      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Focus the narrative on the \"impact achieved\" rather than the target not met, framing the 40% as a huge success in a challenging environment. Emphasize the vital progress made in the most remote and difficult-to-reach areas to demonstrate deep commitment. Frame the current achievement as a crucial \"launchpad,\" highlighting that the next funding round will unlock the potential to reach the final 60% and achieve complete transformation. This approach shifts the focus to the dedicated work and the promise of future, massive impact.",
